DualTopo on RATopo, Subset B

RATopo native components: Han Li et al., RATopo: Improving Lane Topology Reasoning via Redundancy Assignment, ACM MM 2025.
https://github.com/buaa-colalab/RATopo (Apache-2.0).
BEVFormer and OpenMMLab components retain their original source copyright notices.
BWM/GRU and point-attention components derive from LaneSegNet/TopoStreamer-family implementations.
https://github.com/OpenDriveLab/LaneSegNet (Apache-2.0).
OpenLane-V2 evaluator is redistributed with its source notices; dataset images and annotations are not redistributed.
